This bookmark slips easily on your current page, so you can always find easily where you left the story you were reading.

The price of 16€ is for one unit delivery included. We can find an arrangement for multiple items, for example for:

- 2 items you drop at 12€ per unit
- 4 items to 10€ per unit

Can come in multiple colours of your choice.

It's a good that is also included for free in the [Colbys Wallet](notion:f8ddcc4f230b4821aa59c7f117a87acc) if you also want to offer a handmade leather wallet. 👍

